  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing Climate Resilience for Internally  Displaced Persons and Climate-Vulnerable  Communities in Azerbaijan through Kahriz Rehabilitation and Renewable Energy Solutions for Water and Food Securit</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">(Outcome 1) (Climate-vulnerable) households, including IDPs, have improved access to drinking and irrigation water sources in their communities. (Outcome 2) Authorities in Azerbaijan are engaged to institutionalize the rehabilitation of Kahrizes, through public private partnership.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To contribute to enhancing water related adaptation in the context of long-term impacts of climate variability and change in Azerbaijan by improving access to water for drinking and irrigation, improving water governance, and promoting watersaving practices and technologies.&#xbcf8; &#xc0ac;&#xc5c5;&#xc740; &#xae30;&#xd6c4;&#xcde8;&#xc57d;&#xc9c0;&#xc5ed;&#xacfc; &#xc218;&#xbcf5;&#xc9c0;&#xc5ed;&#xc758; &#xc74c;&#xc6a9;&#xc218;&#xc640; &#xad00;&#xac1c;&#xc6a9;&#xc218;&#xb97c; &#xacf5;&#xae09;&#xd568;&#xc73c;&#xb85c;&#xc368; &#xae30;&#xd6c4;&#xbcc0;&#xd654; &#xc601;&#xd5a5;&#xacfc; &#xbb3c; &#xbd80;&#xc871;&#xc73c;&#xb85c; &#xc5b4;&#xb824;&#xc6c0;&#xc744; &#xacaa;&#xace0; &#xc788;&#xb294; &#xc8fc;&#xbbfc;&#xb4e4;&#xc758; &#xc0b6;&#xc758; &#xc9c8; &#xac1c;&#xc120;&#xc5d0; &#xae30;&#xc5ec;</narrative>
  </description>
